{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--rusuy-wish-regarding-others-action","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--argument-structure"],"statement":{"en":"When expressing a wish regarding the desired action of others, rusuy is simply added to the predicate.","ja":"他者の望まれる行動に関する願望を表す場合、述語に単に rusuy が添加される。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"assertive","conditions":["expressing wish regarding actions of others"]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0200-01","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0201-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--rusuy-speaker-wish-and-intention","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"The desiderative auxiliary rusuy primarily indicates a wish or hope of the speaker, and may also express intention without strong determination.","ja":"願望助動詞 rusuy は主として話し手の側の願望や希望を表し、強い決意を伴わない意図を示すこともある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0198-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-05","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--rusuy-addressee-wish-in-questions-conditions","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"In interrogative and conditional sentences, rusuy may indicate a presumed wish or intention on the part of the addressee.","ja":"疑問文および条件文において、rusuy は聞き手の側の推定される願望や意図を示すことがある。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"assertive","conditions":["interrogative or conditional sentences"]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0198-05","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--rusuy-third-person-wish","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"A third person's wish can also be expressed by rusuy.","ja":"三人称の願望も rusuy によって表すことができる。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0198-06","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-07","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--rusuy-stative-lack-desire-idioms","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"With certain verbs, rusuy forms fixed idioms functioning as stative verbs that express a lack of or desire for something, such as mokor rusuy 'sleepy' or ipe rusuy 'hungry'.","ja":"特定の動詞とともに、rusuy は mokor rusuy「眠い」や ipe rusuy「腹が減った」のように何かの不足や欲求を表す状態動詞の固定慣用句を形成する。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido/southwest/shizunai"],"quantifier":"some","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy","mokor rusuy","ipe rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0198-07","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:refsing1986@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0199-08","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--sakhalin-rusuy-desire-and-tendency","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"In Sakhalin Ainu, rusuy expresses desire ('want to') as well as a tendency or inclination to easily fall into an action or state.","ja":"樺太アイヌ語において、rusuy は願望（「〜したい」）に加え、容易にある状態や行為に至る傾向（「〜しやすい」「すぐ〜してしまう」）を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"assertive","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0061-04","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0044-03","stance":"asserts"},{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0076-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-particle-rusui-is-an-optative-desiderative-particle","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--form"],"statement":{"en":"The particle rusui is an optative/desiderative particle expressing desire ('want to...').","ja":"rusui は願望の助詞である。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":[],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusui"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:kindaichi1936@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0165-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-desiderative-auxiliary-rusuy-does-not-generally-take","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--form"],"statement":{"en":"The desiderative auxiliary rusuy does not generally take a personal affix.","ja":"願望助動詞 rusuy は一般には人称接辞を取らない。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0021-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--in-the-sakhalin-dialect-some-speakers-attach-a","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--form"],"statement":{"en":"In the Sakhalin dialect, some speakers attach a personal affix to the auxiliary rusuy 'want'.","ja":"樺太方言では、助動詞rusuy「〜したい」に人称接辞を付加する話者もいる。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"exists","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:shibatani1990@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0048-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-auxiliary-verb-rusuy-want-to-frequently-fuses","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--fusion"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb rusuy 'want to' frequently fuses with the preceding verb to form a single compound verb, taking personal affixes after rusuy.","ja":"助動詞 rusuy「〜たい」は直前の動詞と結合して一語になり、rusuy の後に人称接辞を取ることがよくある。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0291-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--unlike-other-inherent-auxiliaries-rusuy-often-fuses-with","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--fusion"],"statement":{"en":"Unlike other inherent auxiliaries, rusuy often fuses with the immediately preceding verb to form a single compound verb.","ja":"rusuy は他の本来的な助動詞と違って、直前の動詞と合体してひとつの動詞になることがよくある。"},"type":"distribution","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0308-04","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--while-iperusuy-want-to-eat-be-hungry-and","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--fusion"],"statement":{"en":"While iperusuy 'want to eat, be hungry' and konrusuy 'want ...' can formally be decomposed into ipe or kor plus rusuy, in practice they are more commonly used as single unitary words.","ja":"iperusuy「食事がしたい（お腹が空いた）」や konrusuy「〜が欲しい」は、形の上では ipe、kor と rusuy に分解できるが、実際には1語として使われることのほうが普通である。"},"type":"analysis","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"usually","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["iperusuy","konrusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0309-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--a-single-word-combining-a-transitive-verb-with","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--fusion"],"statement":{"en":"A single word combining a transitive verb with an object prefix and rusuy (such as *a-e-rusuy) is ungrammatical in Ainu.","ja":"アイヌ語において、目的語接頭辞を含む他動詞とrusuyが一語に結合した形（*a-e-rusuyなど）を形成することはできない。"},"type":"judgement","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"none","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2025a@pdftotext-pieces/l0014-06","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-auxiliary-verb-etunne-expresses-negative-desiderative-mood","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--scope"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb 'etunne expresses negative desiderative mood ('do not want to').","ja":"助動詞 'etunne は《〜たくない》を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["'etunne"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-15","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-auxiliary-verb-rusuy-expresses-desiderative-mood-want","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary verb rusuy expresses desiderative mood ('want to').","ja":"助動詞 rusuy は《〜たい》を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:sakhalin"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:murasaki2025@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0101-11","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-auxiliary-rusuy-expresses-desire-want-to","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary rusuy expresses desire ('want to').","ja":"rusuy は願望を表す（「〜したい」）。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"all","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0308-03","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-auxiliary-rusuy-expresses-wanting-to-do-something","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--semantics"],"statement":{"en":"The auxiliary rusuy expresses wanting to do something.","ja":"助動詞 rusuy は「〜したい」という意味を表す。"},"type":"form-function","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:hokkaido"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"actual","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0103-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--because-rusuy-is-an-intrinsic-auxiliary-and-not","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"Because rusuy is an intrinsic auxiliary and not a verb, apkas-rusuy cannot be analyzed as object incorporation, and rusuy cannot be separated from the verb with person marking (*apkas a=rusuy).","ja":"rusuy は本来的助動詞であって動詞ではないため、apkas-rusuy を目的語抱合と解釈することはできず、動詞から分離して人称接辞をつけることもできない（*apkas a=rusuy）。"},"type":"judgement","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"unstated","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy","apkas-rusuy","*apkas a=rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:nakagawa2024@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0487-02","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
{"id":"claim:tam/desiderative-rusuy--the-desiderative-marker-rusuy-is-an-auxiliary-verb","revision":1,"topic":"topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topics":["topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy","topic:tam/desiderative-rusuy--verbal-status"],"statement":{"en":"The desiderative marker rusuy is an auxiliary verb, not a verb, and does not undergo person inflection.","ja":"rusuy は動詞ではなく助動詞であるから、人称変化を行わない。"},"type":"membership","scope":{"doculects":["doculect:ainu"],"quantifier":"generic","modality":"necessary","conditions":[]},"forms":["rusuy"],"statements":[{"id":"stmt:sato2008@gemini-3-flash-preview/l0094-01","stance":"asserts"}],"relations":[],"grouped_by":"act:group/2026-09-26T07-52-28-143Z","status":"grouped"}
